OL,3,GNEWSAClothing banks to be removed over
OL,4,Afly-tipping
OL,5,
OL,6,FClothing donation banks are to be
OL,7,Fremoved in two locations after problems
OL,8,Fwith fly-tipping.
OL,10,FIn Hull, a council clothing and
OL,11,Ffootwear bank will be taken away after
OL,12,Frubbish was repeatedly dumped there.
OL,14,FCouncillor Peter North said the site in
OL,15,FBricknell Avenue had become a focal
OL,16,Fpoint for unwanted waste, adding: "This
OL,17,Fbin has almost provided a location
OL,18,Fwhere it seems legitimate to fly-tip."
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
