OL,3,GNEWSAClothing banks to be removed over
OL,4,Afly-tipping
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, in Scunthorpe, Morrisons
OL,7,Fsaid it would be removing donation bins
OL,8,Foutside its Lakeside Parkway store
OL,9,Ffollowing vandalism, theft and
OL,10,Ffly-tipping.
